Required packages:

numpy
scipy
pandas
shapely
pyromat
decimal
bisect
matplotlib

In PuO2_example folder, run using:
python3 ../defap.py PuO2



brouwer task produces "brouwer_output" directory
brouwer diagram can be viewed in this directory by running: python3 plot_brouwer.py



defect_phase task produces the "defect_phases_output" directory
python3 plot_defect_phases_main.py plots the phase diagram that considers all defects, all dopants and all secondary phases
python3 plot_defect_phases_{dopant}.py plots the phase diagram with defects and secondary phases associated with {dopant} only



formation_energy task produces the "form_eng_output" directory if the host material has a bandgap
python3 plot_formation_energies.py creates png files for each defect GROUP showing formation energies as a function of Fermi level for all charge states
python3 plot_min_formation_energies.py creates png files for each defect GROUP showing the minimum formation energy as a function of the Fermi level

if material has no bandgap, then a simple "form_engs.out" file is created that tabulates:
{defect name} {formation energy}
